WEBVTT

00:00:10.920 --> 00:00:15.680
<i>boku ga boku wo aishinuku koto</i>

00:00:10.920 --> 00:00:15.680
<i>Truly loving myself</i>

00:00:15.840 --> 00:00:20.100
<i>naa mada shinjitemo iika?</i>

00:00:15.840 --> 00:00:20.100
<i>Is it alright to still believe in that?</i>

00:00:20.270 --> 00:00:23.890
<i>doko e mukau tabi datoshitemo</i>

00:00:20.270 --> 00:00:23.890
<i>No matter where this journey takes us</i>

00:00:32.740 --> 00:00:36.070
<i>are itsukarada?</i>

00:00:32.740 --> 00:00:36.070
<i>Since when was it?</i>

00:00:36.240 --> 00:00:38.990
<i>honne ga yowane ni nattana</i>

00:00:36.240 --> 00:00:38.990
<i>Being honest became whining</i>

00:00:39.160 --> 00:00:41.540
<i>nigenai koto ga tsuyosa ni natta</i>

00:00:39.160 --> 00:00:41.540
<i>Standing firm became strength</i>

00:00:41.700 --> 00:00:44.830
<i>naa mitsukaranai?</i>

00:00:41.700 --> 00:00:44.830
<i>Have you found it yet?</i>

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:49.210
<i>jishin janaku jibun jishin</i>

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:49.210
<i>Not confidence, your true self</i>

00:00:50.500 --> 00:00:54.720
<i>kitto mada sagasetenai wasuremono ga aruhazu</i>

00:00:50.500 --> 00:00:54.720
<i>There must be something
I've forgotten that I still haven't found</i>

00:00:54.880 --> 00:00:59.050
<i>zutto mada tsutaetenai tsutaetai kotoba</i>

00:00:54.880 --> 00:00:59.050
<i>Words I want to say
That I still haven't said</i>

00:00:59.220 --> 00:01:04.390
<i>mitete kurerunara misete miserunoni</i>

00:00:59.220 --> 00:01:04.390
<i>If you would watch me, I'd captivate you</i>

00:01:04.560 --> 00:01:09.400
<i>boku ga boku wo aishinuku koto</i>

00:01:04.560 --> 00:01:09.400
<i>Truly loving myself</i>

00:01:09.570 --> 00:01:13.570
<i>naa mada shinjitemo iika?</i>

00:01:09.570 --> 00:01:13.570
<i>Is it alright to still believe in that?</i>

00:01:13.740 --> 00:01:17.610
<i>kusuburuno wa chanto moeta karada</i>

00:01:13.740 --> 00:01:17.610
<i>I smolder because I've actually burned</i>

00:01:17.780 --> 00:01:22.700
<i>doko e mukau tabi datoshitemo</i>

00:01:17.780 --> 00:01:22.700
<i>No matter where this journey takes us</i>

00:01:22.870 --> 00:01:27.670
<i>tada me wo mihiraite</i>

00:01:22.870 --> 00:01:27.670
<i>I'll just open my eyes</i>

00:01:27.830 --> 00:01:31.420
<i>yume wo miru</i>

00:01:27.830 --> 00:01:31.420
<i>And dream my dream</i>

00:01:31.590 --> 00:01:33.760
<i>yume wo shiru</i>

00:01:31.590 --> 00:01:33.760
<i>And know my dream</i>

00:01:42.260 --> 00:01:50.440
LAND RIDER LARHART

00:02:08.920 --> 00:02:10.080
Dino...

00:02:20.260 --> 00:02:22.720
Does it hurt?! I bet it does!

00:02:25.390 --> 00:02:29.560
You're braver than I thought.
That pisses me off!

00:02:30.060 --> 00:02:33.900
<i>I've got to fight back! While I still have
stamina and Magic Power!</i>

00:02:34.070 --> 00:02:35.480
<i>I have to do something!</i>

00:02:36.820 --> 00:02:39.950
Oh! I like that face right there!

00:02:40.110 --> 00:02:43.030
I know. I'll do what you did to Ruud!

00:02:43.200 --> 00:02:45.910
I'll blow your head off like him!

00:02:47.410 --> 00:02:49.290
That's it! That's the look!

00:02:49.460 --> 00:02:52.000
Just keep that face!

00:03:02.760 --> 00:03:03.890
Who's there?!

00:03:13.110 --> 00:03:17.530
Great. I'm saved by
the last guy I want saving me.

00:03:18.320 --> 00:03:20.650
Sorry to disappoint.

00:03:25.700 --> 00:03:30.750
I guess I should thank you, Hyunckel.

00:03:35.290 --> 00:03:36.800
I see.

00:03:36.960 --> 00:03:42.970
So that man is the Hyunckel
Master Baran spoke of.

00:03:48.430 --> 00:03:54.310
Popp, it looks like you've been
overextending yourself.

00:03:55.440 --> 00:03:59.190
You tried to stop your enemies alone?

00:03:59.570 --> 00:04:03.530
I didn't have a choice in the matter.

00:04:07.160 --> 00:04:11.750
Dai's memories have been erased...

00:04:12.710 --> 00:04:15.170
by his father, Baran!

00:04:18.000 --> 00:04:22.760
<i>So Dai and Baran
are related by blood after all.</i>

00:04:23.430 --> 00:04:27.600
<i>But what's this
about his memories being erased?</i>

00:04:31.890 --> 00:04:34.480
So, where's Baran?

00:04:35.190 --> 00:04:38.440
He went ahead to get Dai!

00:04:39.400 --> 00:04:40.400
I see.

00:04:43.780 --> 00:04:48.700
Then we don't have time to waste
on these scrubs.

00:04:49.450 --> 00:04:51.200
What?!

00:04:51.660 --> 00:04:54.000
That cocky bastard!

00:04:54.830 --> 00:04:58.340
Former Undead Legion Commander
of the Dark Army or not,

00:04:58.500 --> 00:05:00.960
he's just a human!

00:05:01.510 --> 00:05:06.510
I'll slice you up just like that kid!

00:05:08.010 --> 00:05:09.010
Popp...

00:05:10.010 --> 00:05:12.520
You can have that one.

00:05:12.680 --> 00:05:15.770
Pay him back for what he did to you.

00:05:18.020 --> 00:05:21.860
Are you sure?
I'll be taking your spotlight.

00:05:22.030 --> 00:05:25.780
What the hell?! Are you serious?!

00:05:25.950 --> 00:05:30.160
That battered little kid can't fight me!

00:05:30.330 --> 00:05:32.370
You fight me!

00:05:33.790 --> 00:05:37.170
There's no way you can beat Popp.

00:05:39.040 --> 00:05:41.920
If by chance you should...

00:05:42.500 --> 00:05:44.420
then I'll fight you.

00:05:48.680 --> 00:05:52.510
This guy is a complete moron!

00:05:52.680 --> 00:05:57.690
You're letting the guy you saved die!

00:05:58.020 --> 00:05:59.270
Fine then.

00:06:00.560 --> 00:06:04.400
This time I'll finish the job!

00:06:06.490 --> 00:06:10.160
And then I'll be coming for you!

00:06:15.330 --> 00:06:18.670
<i>All I need are two more spells!</i>

00:06:19.330 --> 00:06:22.500
<i>I hope my Magic Power holds out!</i>

00:06:25.710 --> 00:06:27.220
Die!

00:06:27.970 --> 00:06:29.010
Levizoom!

00:06:32.220 --> 00:06:35.640
What a joke!
You want to fight me in the air?!

00:06:37.600 --> 00:06:38.690
What?!

00:06:39.480 --> 00:06:42.860
I told you, you can't beat him.

00:06:44.730 --> 00:06:47.440
<i>I hit you with my Bloody Scryde.</i>

00:06:48.280 --> 00:06:49.700
It leaves a mark.

00:06:51.950 --> 00:06:57.580
You can have the rest of my Magic Power!

00:06:57.750 --> 00:06:58.710
Bang!

00:07:07.420 --> 00:07:09.340
Galdandy!

00:07:13.680 --> 00:07:15.600
I did it.

00:07:15.970 --> 00:07:21.810
But my Magic Power's all empty.

00:07:22.850 --> 00:07:24.980
You did well.

00:07:25.360 --> 00:07:29.150
Don't worry. Get some rest.

00:07:31.820 --> 00:07:34.740
I'm not worried.

00:07:34.910 --> 00:07:41.080
Your attitude sucks,
but I know how strong you are.

00:07:41.250 --> 00:07:46.750
I think I'll be taking you up
on getting some rest now.

00:07:55.220 --> 00:07:58.350
<i>You truly did a good job, Popp.</i>

00:08:00.100 --> 00:08:05.270
Curse you! How dare you
do that to Galdandy!

00:08:06.770 --> 00:08:09.230
You'll pay for that!

00:08:09.610 --> 00:08:12.360
I'll pay for that?

00:08:12.530 --> 00:08:17.370
That's right!
This time, I, Borahorn shall...

00:08:23.620 --> 00:08:24.750
Borahorn!

00:08:25.830 --> 00:08:28.210
You're the ones who'll pay.

00:08:29.130 --> 00:08:32.800
I don't know who you are...

00:08:35.430 --> 00:08:38.300
<i>What an imposing Aura!</i>

00:08:39.760 --> 00:08:43.520
...but after what you did
to my junior disciple,

00:08:44.520 --> 00:08:47.690
don't expect to walk away from this!

00:08:48.150 --> 00:08:52.400
You bastard! You broke my precious fangs!

00:08:53.360 --> 00:08:55.910
I'll pulverize you!

00:08:56.490 --> 00:08:58.950
Just fight already.

00:08:59.780 --> 00:09:01.200
I'm in a hurry.

00:09:01.700 --> 00:09:05.920
You brat! You think you're so strong?!

00:09:06.080 --> 00:09:11.500
The strength of Sea Rider Borahorn
is unrivaled in the world!

00:09:11.710 --> 00:09:13.970
Taste it for yourself!

00:09:21.100 --> 00:09:25.770
Impossible! Where does such a frail body
hide such strength?!

00:09:26.810 --> 00:09:31.650
You really think that this is
"unrivaled in the world"?

00:09:32.440 --> 00:09:38.240
My friend has
twice the strength in his arms.

00:09:38.410 --> 00:09:40.830
Why you...!

00:09:48.670 --> 00:09:53.550
Well? Weren't you going to pulverize me?

00:09:55.010 --> 00:09:57.260
I was just about to!

00:09:58.050 --> 00:10:00.100
Glacial Breath!

00:10:06.020 --> 00:10:07.980
<i>That should finish it.</i>

00:10:09.060 --> 00:10:14.070
<i>Borahorn's Glacial Breath
is as strong as a Kacrackle spell.</i>

00:10:27.540 --> 00:10:33.420
<i>If I strike someone when they're
frozen solid by my Glacial Breath...</i>

00:10:33.590 --> 00:10:36.590
<i>they shatter like glass!</i>

00:10:37.550 --> 00:10:40.970
<i>This is how I've always won!</i>

00:10:45.640 --> 00:10:49.890
<i>As promised, I'll pulverize you!</i>

00:10:55.150 --> 00:10:58.700
<i>What's that? What is he doing?</i>

00:10:59.110 --> 00:11:02.200
<i>No, he can't do anything! How could he?!</i>

00:11:02.370 --> 00:11:04.370
Now shatter!

00:11:07.870 --> 00:11:09.290
What?!

00:11:15.500 --> 00:11:16.300
That's...!

00:11:16.710 --> 00:11:19.590
My Glacial Breath didn't work?!

00:11:32.560 --> 00:11:34.560
Play time is over!

00:11:40.490 --> 00:11:42.610
Bloody Scryde!

00:12:08.100 --> 00:12:09.640
Something's strange.

00:12:10.430 --> 00:12:14.020
It seems the enemy
has decreased in number.

00:12:26.410 --> 00:12:29.080
Are you next?

00:12:29.700 --> 00:12:32.080
Not bad for a human.

00:12:33.080 --> 00:12:37.630
But don't assume I'm like the other two.

00:12:38.290 --> 00:12:40.460
Stop trying to bluff.

00:12:40.880 --> 00:12:46.590
As you can see, my armour
repels attack spells and breath.

00:12:46.760 --> 00:12:48.390
I know.

00:12:48.550 --> 00:12:54.350
That was made by Lon Beruk,
the greatest craftsman in the Underworld.

00:12:55.060 --> 00:12:57.020
It's the Dark Armour Blade.

00:12:58.650 --> 00:13:03.610
This was a gift. I don't know who made it.

00:13:03.990 --> 00:13:05.360
I see.

00:13:05.700 --> 00:13:09.030
But I wasn't bluffing just now.

00:13:09.200 --> 00:13:15.580
I'm not very good at spells.
More importantly, my weapon rivals yours!

00:13:17.290 --> 00:13:19.340
Wait, is that...?!

00:13:19.500 --> 00:13:25.090
Take a good look
at Lon Beruk's other masterpiece!

00:13:27.840 --> 00:13:30.300
The Dark Armour Spear!

00:13:31.260 --> 00:13:32.350
Amdo!

00:13:46.900 --> 00:13:49.450
BLOODY SCRYDE

00:13:51.950 --> 00:13:54.450
FULLHEAL
HEAL-TYPE SPELL

00:13:54.950 --> 00:13:56.040
Amdo!

00:14:09.640 --> 00:14:11.640
The same armour as me?!

00:14:12.350 --> 00:14:14.060
And now we're equal.

00:14:15.350 --> 00:14:22.320
No. I'm a better warrior,
so I guess I have the advantage?

00:14:23.230 --> 00:14:24.530
Save your lies!

00:14:30.160 --> 00:14:34.660
You've shown me your best attack.
I should repay in kind.

00:14:46.760 --> 00:14:49.680
Now see my best attack!

00:15:11.610 --> 00:15:17.660
I'd say that was a decent dodge,
but that was merely a greeting.

00:15:18.700 --> 00:15:20.960
Take a look at your helm.

00:15:30.130 --> 00:15:31.220
Well?

00:15:32.010 --> 00:15:36.640
You claimed to be the greatest swordsman,

00:15:36.970 --> 00:15:40.390
but can you do that with a sword?

00:15:42.400 --> 00:15:45.400
<i>He's right. Without terrifying speed,</i>

00:15:45.570 --> 00:15:50.900
<i>and needle-point accuracy,
such a feat is impossible.</i>

00:15:52.610 --> 00:15:57.200
<i>And he did it without even
scratching my forehead!</i>

00:15:59.910 --> 00:16:01.870
Looks like you understand.

00:16:03.290 --> 00:16:06.290
Indeed, you're a powerful swordsman.

00:16:06.840 --> 00:16:10.840
But your blade is all muscle.

00:16:11.010 --> 00:16:13.300
You're no match for me.

00:16:13.970 --> 00:16:19.310
If I wanted to, I could easily
pierce your heart

00:16:19.470 --> 00:16:22.850
before you finished blinking.

00:16:23.770 --> 00:16:27.110
Rubbish! If you really can do that...

00:16:28.230 --> 00:16:30.030
then let's see you try!

00:16:38.450 --> 00:16:39.950
Dammit!

00:16:40.120 --> 00:16:41.450
Wave Slash!

00:16:48.670 --> 00:16:54.340
<i>Even Wave Slash, the fastest Avan Style
attack can't even scratch him!</i>

00:16:56.640 --> 00:16:58.970
That appears to be your limit.

00:17:02.180 --> 00:17:05.730
I see. You have power in your attacks.

00:17:07.560 --> 00:17:12.780
But even with that power,
unless you can hit me,

00:17:12.940 --> 00:17:14.740
it's meaningless!

00:17:30.380 --> 00:17:35.260
<i>It's the same as before!
I can't see his strikes at all!</i>

00:17:36.180 --> 00:17:38.890
<i>It's just a flash of light!</i>

00:17:52.150 --> 00:17:56.360
<i>Dammit! I have to do something
about his attacks!</i>

00:17:58.780 --> 00:18:00.030
Give it up!

00:18:00.580 --> 00:18:02.790
You'll never see my attacks!

00:18:17.260 --> 00:18:20.390
And now, as promised...

00:18:22.600 --> 00:18:25.310
I shall pierce your heart!

00:18:29.350 --> 00:18:30.860
<i>He's strong!</i>

00:18:31.770 --> 00:18:37.110
<i>He's on a completely different level
than the other two!</i>

00:18:46.250 --> 00:18:51.960
<i>Trying to see
those speed attacks... is impossible!</i>

00:18:59.260 --> 00:19:03.010
Oh? You still haven't given up?

00:19:08.230 --> 00:19:13.770
<i>It's a gamble,
but I'll have to let him hit me...</i>

00:19:14.650 --> 00:19:17.900
<i>and strike back while he's not moving!</i>

00:19:19.070 --> 00:19:23.160
<i>If I can withstand his attack
and pull him in,</i>

00:19:23.320 --> 00:19:27.450
<i>then I just unleash
my Bloody Scryde straight ahead!</i>

00:19:27.790 --> 00:19:32.170
<i>My attacks are more devastating than his!</i>

00:19:38.260 --> 00:19:39.800
Very well.

00:19:40.550 --> 00:19:43.340
Then I shall end it with this.

00:19:44.180 --> 00:19:45.600
Die!

00:19:47.890 --> 00:19:49.310
Now!

00:19:49.480 --> 00:19:51.100
Bloody Scryde!

00:19:55.020 --> 00:19:56.070
<i>No!</i>

00:19:57.400 --> 00:20:00.690
<i>He merely threw his gauntlet at me!</i>

00:20:03.110 --> 00:20:05.780
I thought you would do that!

00:20:05.950 --> 00:20:10.500
But I'm not foolish enough
to fall for that!

00:20:10.830 --> 00:20:14.960
Take this!
The Land Rider's most powerful strike!

00:20:16.340 --> 00:20:18.710
Sunder Claw!

00:20:25.050 --> 00:20:27.140
<i>Unbelievable!</i>

00:20:27.890 --> 00:20:33.690
<i>Nothing I could do worked on him!</i>

00:20:35.690 --> 00:20:36.810
<i>Dai...</i>

00:20:49.160 --> 00:20:51.950
You are only human after all.

00:20:58.840 --> 00:21:02.340
Something strange with the enemy?
What do you mean?

00:21:03.760 --> 00:21:05.890
I'm not sure.

00:21:06.840 --> 00:21:10.770
Here. Let me try my crystal ball again.

00:21:12.640 --> 00:21:13.890
What's that noise?

00:21:19.520 --> 00:21:20.400
Dai!

00:21:20.570 --> 00:21:23.610
Someone's coming.

00:21:24.610 --> 00:21:28.780
I can tell. I know him!

00:21:30.870 --> 00:21:35.250
Dino, no matter where they hide you...

00:21:35.830 --> 00:21:40.040
I can detect where you are.

00:21:41.920 --> 00:21:46.090
For we are connected
by our bond of blood.

00:22:04.320 --> 00:22:07.280
<i>Even if you face the devil
With logic on your side</i>

00:22:04.320 --> 00:22:07.280
<i>tatoe akuma ni seiron kazashite
mukatte mitemo</i>

00:22:07.450 --> 00:22:11.240
<i>It may just be a rationalization</i>

00:22:07.450 --> 00:22:11.240
<i>sore wa akumade seitouka
sashite chigai wa naikamo</i>

00:22:11.410 --> 00:22:15.330
<i>Even now, even now I waver</i>

00:22:11.410 --> 00:22:15.330
<i>ima mo ima mo yureteiru kedo</i>

00:22:15.500 --> 00:22:19.380
<i>How far will we go?</i>

00:22:15.500 --> 00:22:19.380
<i>bokura wa dokomade yukuno</i>

00:22:19.540 --> 00:22:22.670
<i>I heard a voice like an angel's whisper</i>

00:22:19.540 --> 00:22:22.670
<i>tenshi no sasayaki nimo nita
koe ga kikoeta</i>

00:22:22.840 --> 00:22:26.590
<i>Maybe it was an imposter's illusion
It still rang in my ears</i>

00:22:22.840 --> 00:22:26.590
<i>hatamata petenshi no mayakashi
hitokiwa mimi ni hibiiteita</i>

00:22:26.760 --> 00:22:30.300
<i>Exposed to love and sorrow</i>

00:22:26.760 --> 00:22:30.300
<i>ai ni hiai ni sarasare nagara</i>

00:22:30.470 --> 00:22:34.600
<i>On the path strewn with pride</i>

00:22:30.470 --> 00:22:34.600
<i>hokori mamire michi no tochu</i>

00:22:36.310 --> 00:22:38.640
<i>Fleeting moments of cowardice</i>

00:22:36.310 --> 00:22:38.640
<i>kiete wa ukabu touhikou</i>

00:22:40.190 --> 00:22:42.440
<i>The SOS I held back</i>

00:22:40.190 --> 00:22:42.440
<i>nomikonda SOS</i>

00:22:44.020 --> 00:22:48.030
<i>I clenched my trembling fist</i>

00:22:44.020 --> 00:22:48.030
<i>furueru te wo nigirishimeta</i>

00:22:48.610 --> 00:22:53.620
<i>That single little promise</i>

00:22:48.610 --> 00:22:53.620
<i>tatta hitotsu no chiisana yakusoku ga</i>

00:22:53.780 --> 00:22:57.410
<i>Those trivial little memories</i>

00:22:53.780 --> 00:22:57.410
<i>honno sasaina omoidetachi ga</i>

00:22:57.580 --> 00:22:59.710
<i>They're still in my heart</i>

00:22:57.580 --> 00:22:59.710
<i>itsumade tattemo kono mune wo</i>

00:22:59.870 --> 00:23:03.880
<i>As embers that keep me burning</i>

00:22:59.870 --> 00:23:03.880
<i>kogashi tsuzukeru tomoshibi ni naru</i>

00:23:04.040 --> 00:23:08.380
<i>A single transparent beam of light</i>

00:23:04.040 --> 00:23:08.380
<i>tada hitosuji no toumei na hikari ga</i>

00:23:08.550 --> 00:23:11.550
<i>Lights the way before me</i>

00:23:08.550 --> 00:23:11.550
<i>me no mae wo terashite yuku</i>

00:23:11.720 --> 00:23:16.220
<i>There is little that I can do</i>

00:23:11.720 --> 00:23:16.220
<i>boku ni dekiru koto wa ikutsu mo naisa</i>

